Support for macsCAD

Should you run into any difficulties with the software you can contact myself, Steven Holmes, developer and owner via email at mail@cyberlizard.co.uk.

In the event you do experience problems, send me the crash logs as well as a thorough description of the problem.  Tell me if it is random or repeatable and if possible send screenshots or video that makes trying to resolve the problem much simpler.  I will do my best to remove any bugs from the software.
